  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can magically create a Tiny quill in your free hand. It has the following properties, and it disappears if you create another one or if you die.</p><ul><li>It doesn't require ink: when you write with it, it produces ink of a color of your choice.</li><li>The time you must spend to copy a spell into your spellbook equals 2 minutes per spell level if you use the quill.</li><li>You can erase anything you wrote with the quill by waving its feather over the text as a Bonus Action, provided the text is within 5 feet of you.</li></ul>",
